<title>HONG KONG: AMMB unit sets $100 mln three-year FRCD.</title>
<headline>AMMB unit sets $100 mln three-year FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Societe Generale Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AMMB INTERNATIONAL (LABUAN) LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ARAB-MALAYSIAN MERCHANT BANK BERHAD</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$100 MLN   COUPON	L+25BP   MATURITY 3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	   ISS PRICE   PAR</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	   CALLS	 NONE     REPLIES  11.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	   REPAYMENT   BULLET   DENOMS   $500K</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	   SALE LMTS   STANDARD TAX PROV --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  MALAYSIA     GOV LAW     ENGLISH  PAY DATE --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p> CO-LEAD MANAGERS	US$5 MLN+   13.5 BP  ALL-IN  29.5</p>
<p> MANAGERS		  US$3-4 MLN   9.0 BP  ALL-IN  28.0</p>
<p> ARRANGERS   SOCIETE GENERALE ASIA, DEVELOPMENT BANK OF</p>
<p>		 SINGAPORE, DKB ASIA AND TOKAI ASIA.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
